{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17667","headline":"州民有献杏者瑰丽溢目因感花未几聊以成咏 · 羊士谔","name":"州民有献杏者瑰丽溢目因感花未几聊以成咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南郭东风赏杏坛，几株芳树昨留欢。\n却忆落花飘绮席，忽惊如实满雕盘。\n蛾眉半歛千金薄，鷤鴂初鸣百草阑。\n志士古来悲节换，美人啼鸟亦长叹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17667.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17667","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}